              "explanation": {
                "zh": "表示人为地把某物变成某个状态或选定某物。",
                "en": "Shows making something into a na-adjective/noun state or choosing something."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "l44-grammar-08",
          "pattern": "Vやすく / Vにくくなります",
